      "description": "Watch Armenia vs Latvia highlights and goals from UEFA Nations League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on September 25, 2026. A tactical battle in the Nations League On September 25, 2026, Armenia faced off against Latvia in a compelling UEFA Nations League fixture, with both sides eager to establish dominance early on. The match developed into a rigorous test of discipline, as players fought for every inch on the pitch throughout a high-stakes first half. Breaking the deadlock The deadlock was shattered in the 31st minute when Georgiy Arutiunian found the back of the net, clinical in his finish after a well-placed assist from Eduard Spertsyan . This goal shifted the momentum firmly in favor of the hosts as they entered the break with a narrow lead. As the second half unfolded, the tactical depth of the Armenia squad proved vital. After coming off the bench, Zhirayr Shaghoyan turned provider in the 75th minute, delivering a crucial pass for Artur Gharibyan to score. This decisive strike effectively extinguished any hopes of a comeback from Latvia , allowing the home side to cruise comfortably to the final whistle."
